{"sourceUrl":"https://sg.jlu.edu.cn/info/1081/21621.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:29.437205+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://sg.jlu.edu.cn/info/1081/21621.htm","html":"<div><div>\n<p><span><span>亲爱的同学们：</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>吉林大学商学与管理学院设有工商管理</span></span><span>学</span><span>、</span><span><span>应用经济学</span></span><span>、</span><span><span>信息资源管理</span></span><span>和</span><span><span>管理科学与工程四个一级学科博士学位授权点；现有金融学、数量经济学、管理科学与工程（</span></span><span>①</span><span><span>评价理论与决策方法研究方向；</span></span><span>②</span><span><span>信息系统与商务智能研究方向；</span></span><span>③</span><span><span>工程项目管理研究方向；</span></span><span>④</span><span><span>物流管理研究方向）、会计学、企业管理、技术经济及管理</span></span><span>和</span><span><span>信息资源管理七个硕士学位授权点。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>学院拥有一支教学经验丰富</span></span><span>、</span><span><span>学术造诣较高</span></span><span>、学缘</span><span><span>结构合理的师资队伍，并常年聘请国内外一流专家、学者</span></span><span>及</span><span><span>企业家来院讲学。学院在教学和科研等方面逐步形成了优势与特色，为国民经济建设培养了大批优秀人才，</span></span><span>其中包含</span><span><span>省部级领导、知名企业家、</span></span><span>著名</span><span><span>专家学者和学科带头人。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>为促进各高校优秀大学生之间的</span></span><span>交流互鉴，加深青年学生对我院学科前沿成果的了解</span><span><span>，吸引优秀本科生到商学与管理学院攻读硕士学位，学院</span></span><span>将</span><span>于</span><span><span>7</span><span>月上旬</span></span><span><span>举办</span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span>025</span><span>年校园学术活动开放日</span><span><span>活动。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>一、申请</span></span></strong><strong><span>条件</span></strong></p>\n<p><span>1. <span>拥护中国共产党的领导，热爱祖国，品德优良，遵纪守法，学风端正，身心健康，在校期间无违纪违法行为和违反学术道德行为</span></span><span>。</span></p>\n<p><span>2. </span><span>申请人</span><span><span>英语水平</span></span><span>良好</span><span><span>，原则上达到</span></span><span>全国大学英语</span><span><span>六级</span></span><span>考试成绩</span><span>425<span>分</span></span><span>及</span><span><span>以上</span></span><span>，</span><span><span>或具备同等水平的国家级</span></span><span>英</span><span><span>语考试成绩。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>3. </span><span>申请人应对管理学和经济学相关领域具有浓厚兴趣，有潜在的科研和创新能力，具有一定管理类和经济类专业知识基础，同时欢迎理学、工学</span><span>学科</span><span>门类的优秀学生跨学科申请。</span></p>\n<p><span>4. <span>申请人应为预计取得所在学校推荐免试资格的</span><span>2026</span><span>年应届毕业生</span></span><span>。</span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>二、申请专业</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>金融学、数量经济学、管理科学与工程（</span></span><span>①</span><span><span>评价理论与决策方法研究方向；</span></span><span>②</span><span><span>信息系统与商务智能研究方向；</span></span><span>③</span><span><span>工程项目管理研究方向；</span></span><span>④</span><span><span>物流管理研究方向）、会计学、企业管理、技术经济及管理</span></span><span>和</span><span><span>信息资源管理。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>三、申请流程</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span>1. </span><span><span>申请人须于</span><span>6</span><span>月</span><span>2</span></span><span>0</span><span><span>日下午</span><span>1</span></span><span>6</span><span><span>:</span></span><span>00</span><span>前</span><span><span>登录</span></span><span>“校园学术活动开放日报名</span><span><span>系统</span></span><span>”</span><span><span>（</span>https://yzb.jlu.edu.cn/<span>）</span></span><span>进行报名，同时发送申请材料</span><span><span>，逾期不予补报。</span></span><span>每位申请人限填一个专业志愿且为第一志愿。</span></p>\n<p><span>2.</span> <a href=\"mailto:%E5%B0%86%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%8B%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%9D%90%E6%96%99%E6%89%AB%E6%8F%8F%E6%88%901%E4%B8%AAPDF%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%91%E9%80%81%E8%87%B3%E9%82%AE%E7%AE%B13881993112@qq.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>将以下申请材料扫描成</span><span>1<span>个</span><span>PDF</span><span>文件，发送至邮箱</span><span>3881993112@qq.com</span></span></a>(已满),<span>sg85166139@163.com</span><span>（新增）</span><span>，</span><span><span>邮件以“姓名</span><span>—</span></span><span>申</span><span>请</span><span>专业名称</span><span>—校园学术活动开放日”命名。</span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>1</span><span>）在报名系统中填写并生成的《吉林大学</span></span><span>2025<span>年校园学术活动开放日报名表》；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>2</span><span>）本科阶段前五学期成绩单原件以及成绩排名证明（需加盖所在院校教务部门公章）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>3</span><span>）</span></span><span><span>专家推荐书（见附件</span>1<span>）</span></span><span>两</span><span><span>份；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>4</span><span>）</span></span><span><span>个人简历一份</span></span><span>；</span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>5</span><span>）英语水平证明；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>6</span><span>）</span></span><span><span>其他</span></span><span>证明</span><span><span>材料（</span></span><span>代表性获奖证书和学术科研成果，如发表论文、出版物或其他原创性成果等</span><span><span>）。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>四、其它事项</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>1</span></span><span>. </span><span><span>学院成立</span><span>“校园学术活动开放日”领导小组，根据申请者提交材料</span></span><span>进行</span><span>审核</span><span>并</span><span>确定入选名单。本次校园学术活动开放日，学院将</span><span><span>以教育背景、学业水平、科研能力</span></span><span>和</span><span><span>综合素质等为主要评价依据</span></span><span>对</span><span>申请</span><span>人选进行筛选。</span></p>\n<p><span><span>2</span></span><span>. <span>学院将</span></span><span>于</span><span>2025<span>年</span><span>6</span><span>月下旬</span></span><span>在学院网站公布入选名单</span><span><span>（</span>http://sg.jlu.edu.cn/<span>），</span></span><span>入选</span><span><span>同学请扫码进入微信群，未进入微信群的同学视为自动放弃</span></span><span>。</span></p>\n<p><span><span>3</span></span><span>. </span><span>在本次活动中学术能力考核合格，并具备所在学校</span><span>2026<span>年硕士研究生</span><span>“</span><span>推荐免试资格</span><span>”</span><span>的学生，考核成绩可以</span></span><span>作</span><span><span>为推免阶段的重要参考依据</span></span><span>。</span></p>\n<p><span><span>4</span></span><span>. <span>校园学术活动开放日期间，商学与管理学院</span></span><span>将</span><span><span>为</span></span><span>同学</span><span><span>提供免费食宿（长春市及本校学生不提供住宿），并购买人身意外保险</span></span><span>。</span></p>\n<p><span><span>5</span></span><span>. </span><span>校园学术活动开放日具</span><span><span>体活动内容及安排另行通知。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>本通知由吉林大学商学与管理学院</span><span>“校园学术活动开放日”领导小组负责解释。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>欢迎有意报考我院研究生的优秀学子踊跃报名！</span></p>\n<p><span><span>联系人：付老师</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>联系电话：</span>0431-85166139</span></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><span><span>商学与管理学院研究生</span></span><span>培养</span><span><span>办公室</span></span></p>\n<p><span>2025<span>年</span><span>6</span><span>月</span></span><span><span>12</span></span><span><span>日</span></span></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n</div></div>","textSha256":"2a7208f26a3223f09e98a937a941786b99e14af44a51f2a489f80e376644737a","textLength":1512,"sourceSha256":"ed989f65e5436b93d9d9b8cb927a111f277d240408464c895e96103b8cf50dda","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[{"name":"专家推荐书.docx","url":"https://sg.jlu.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1812431662&wbfileid=16569127"}],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-41864feeb40d9a65fbf2","title":"2025年吉林大学商学与管理学院2025年校园学术活动开放日的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:29.437205+00:00"}
